<title>USA: Amrion seeks sale or business combination.</title>
<headline>Amrion seeks sale or business combination.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amrion Inc said on Thursday that is exploring a sale of the company or a business combination through its previously announced hiring of the Wallach Co.</p>
<p>Amrion said no deals are pending, but that any move is intended to assist in maximizing shareholder value.</p>
<p>Amrion makes and markets nutritional supplements.</p>
</text>
